#: ../../source/json-stringify-safe_CHANGELOG.md:1
msgid "Unreleased"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-stringify-safe_CHANGELOG.md:2
msgid ""
"Fixes stringify to only take ancestors into account when checking "
"circularity.   It previously assumed every visited object was circular "
"which led to [false positives][issue9].   Uses the tiny serializer I "
"wrote for [Must.js][must] a year and a half ago."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-stringify-safe_CHANGELOG.md:7
msgid "Fixes calling the `replacer` function in the proper context (`thisArg`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-stringify-safe_CHANGELOG.md:8
msgid ""
"Fixes calling the `cycleReplacer` function in the proper context "
"(`thisArg`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/json-stringify-safe_CHANGELOG.md:9
msgid ""
"Speeds serializing by a factor of Big-O(h-my-god-it-linearly-searched-"
"every-object) it had ever seen. Searching only the ancestors for a "
"circular references speeds up things considerably."
msgstr ""

